ITEM 4 (packaging) — BLOCKED ON USER INPUT
---------------------------------------------------------------------
electron-builder packaging, code signing and notarization require the
user's Apple Developer ID credentials (and a Windows certificate for
Windows signing). SBOM (cargo cyclonedx, pnpm sbom), cargo audit and
cargo deny CAN be prepared but the signed/notarized artifact cannot be
produced without those secrets. Requested from the user; everything
else in Phase 4 is complete.

